        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka aioresio ebe: Koany, abili akabwa naka Elam, ŋes amun naka agogonokec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
